## Coding Standards

### Managers
Each manager will have 3 classes:
- [ManagerName].cs -> This is the main class
- [ManagerName]Events.cs -> This is the class containing all the public events and invokers
- [ManagerName]Patches.cs -> This is the class for the harmony patches.

Code standards:
- Patches class should have the same region grouping as the events class